            "review_text": "Atik\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam20 contributions\n2\nGreat coffee!\nDec 2019 • Solo\nIt’s a new place, just next to my office building and I prefer to have a coffee here not just because it’s close but also because it has a great taste and aroma which I really like about Vietnamese coffee. Looking for coffee, pls drop by this place - Ms. Linh and her staff is very friendly and their menu has lots of coffee options so Trung Nguyen coffee it is!\nWritten December 2, 2019",
